# Homepage Executive Committee (Team) Section

## Overview

Homepage **Team** shows active `executive-committee-team-members` for the current tenant, sorted by `priorityOrder` ascending (lower = higher rank). Modernist home: [`ModernistHomePage.tsx`](mdc:src/components/modernist/ModernistHomePage.tsx) `#team-section`. Classic / MOSC pattern: [`TeamSection.tsx`](mdc:src/components/TeamSection.tsx) (mosc-temp reference).

## Data source (KCNJ)

Roster + photos for tenant `mcefee_org_nj_7` come from the static charity site:

- HTML: `F:\project_workspace\NJ-Malayalees-MCEEFEE-Charity-Site\index.html` (`#team-section`)
- Images: `...\images\team_members\`

| Name | Role | Image | Priority |
