Re-seed (deletes existing tenant rows, creates + uploads images):

```bash
node scripts/seed-mcefee-executive-team.mjs
```

## Fetch (public homepage)

```tsx
// ✅ DO: Same-origin proxy, active only, priority ascending
fetch(
  '/api/proxy/executive-committee-team-members?isActive.equals=true&sort=priorityOrder,asc',
  { cache: 'no-store' }
);
// Then parseExecutiveCommitteeTeamMembersResponse(data)
```

- Do **not** add `tenantId.equals` on proxy GETs (proxy injects it).
- Gate with `useTenantSettings().showExecutiveCommitteeSection` (or `showTeamSection` alias).
- Admin CRUD + image upload: [`ApiServerActions.ts`](mdc:src/app/admin/executive-committee/ApiServerActions.ts), [`ExecutiveCommitteeUploadActions.ts`](mdc:src/app/admin/executive-committee/ExecutiveCommitteeUploadActions.ts) (`isTeamMemberProfileImage=true`).

## Display

- **Modernist**: `mh-eyebrow` “Team”, heading matching charity copy, `mh-team-grid` / `mh-team-card` / `mh-team-photo`
- **Classic**: `HomeSectionRail` + glass cards (mosc-temp `TeamSection`)
- Show `designation` (fallback `title`); photo from `profileImageUrl`

